{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415703","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415703","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041570301:1":{"text":"咕唔！汝竟与吾如此相像！","source_cn":"咕唔！汝竟与吾如此相像！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4E65EF7010D61BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570302:1":{"text":"外乡人，汝来自何方？汝之同胞是否都如你这般相貌？","source_cn":"外乡人，汝来自何方？汝之同胞是否都如你这般相貌？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x831B731CEC92A123","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570303:1":{"text":"相似？我看不出任何相似点。","source_cn":"相似？我看不出任何相似点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45824ACC7F85D391","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570304:1":{"text":"我的家园早已倾覆。现在，我属于巫毒神庙。","source_cn":"我的家园早已倾覆。现在，我属于巫毒神庙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B49E13CCBBFC3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570305:1":{"text":"至于我的族人，他们都死在了保卫家园与自由的战争里。他们都是英勇的战士。","source_cn":"至于我的族人，他们都死在了保卫家园与自由的战争里。他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD2E277AFF66FFBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570306:1":{"text":"……吾能听出汝之伤痛。请节哀！","source_cn":"……吾能听出汝之伤痛。请节哀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x799755A4A9C2E3A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570307:1":{"text":"我早已学会忍耐。","source_cn":"我早已学会忍耐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4A3B42C68280657","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570308:1":{"text":"忍耐！何需如此？","source_cn":"忍耐！何需如此？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE605211EEEB81F2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570309:1":{"text":"吾等生存于世，难免心中郁结，宣泄压力为人之常情。","source_cn":"吾等生存于世，难免心中郁结，宣泄压力为人之常情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x033075706CED2484","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570310:1":{"text":"汝可以像吾一般，外出奔跑，感受风与自然。","source_cn":"汝可以像吾一般，外出奔跑，感受风与自然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC302BD97339BBD5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570311:1":{"text":"呵，我的确会这样做。","source_cn":"呵，我的确会这样做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2881B5E298BEE14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570312:1":{"text":"追逐飞射的箭矢，追逐落日，追逐自由，都会让人心情愉悦。","source_cn":"追逐飞射的箭矢，追逐落日，追逐自由，都会让人心情愉悦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8175837CED4B87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570313:1":{"text":"正是如此！趁着奔跑后的平静时刻梳理毛发，亦是一种别样享受。","source_cn":"正是如此！趁着奔跑后的平静时刻梳理毛发，亦是一种别样享受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAB541C1D708CE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570314:1":{"text":"……看来你我之间，确实有不少共同语言。","source_cn":"……看来你我之间，确实有不少共同语言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F6D6B43D4D6A428","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570315:1":{"text":"外族的战士，赞东与你立约，待职责卸去，与我来一场速度的较量！","source_cn":"外族的战士，赞东与你立约，待职责卸去，与我来一场速度的较量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84AED4733B348655","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041570316:1":{"text":"在奔跑一事上，我还从未尝败绩。","source_cn":"在奔跑一事上，我还从未尝败绩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70497952E9D3D1A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041570317:1":{"text":"咕唔！吾正有此意！","source_cn":"咕唔！吾正有此意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29ADD534F58F47DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡夫拉":{"text":"卡夫拉","source":"卡夫拉","status":"source"},"speaker:赞东":{"text":"赞东","source":"赞东","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":2}}